{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45619","headline":"上刘商州 · 贯休","name":"上刘商州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周邵吁嘘气，结爲祯祥云。\n客从远方来，持此将赠君。\n时命偶不谬，授馆终南东。\n愔愔良吏师，不寐如老农。\n丘轲文之天，代天有余功。\n代天复代天，后稷何所从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}